Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:18:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Dump: DumpPage container with DumpPageContext and a route
 adapter

DumpScreen becomes DumpPage, the page's container; capture, its error
and load more reach the composer and the feed through DumpPageContext.
The route's inline unwrapping of the feed and its period key move into
the pure adapter toDumpPageProps (utils/dump.ts, unit-tested), which the
route and the Dump scenarios both run.

